Package: ksCompare
Title: Smart Data Frame Comparison in the Spirit of SAS PROC COMPARE
Version: 0.2.3
Authors@R: 
    person("Igor", "Aleschenkov", , "igor.aleschenkov@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A tidyverse-native engine for comparing two data frames in the
    spirit of SAS 'PROC COMPARE', with extensions for clinical/pharma
    workflows: per-column tolerances (absolute, relative, and ULP), smart
    column matching, intelligent type reconciliation, SAS special-missing
    awareness, diff-pattern detection, and rich HTML/Excel reports.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
